# CALTECH 11-23: <output2..7> = the PROD1121b production outputs (bin hydro_w/m1/m1_vet/m1_face, log, periodic rst); orion's deck had the CALSMOKE rst-only output2 (dt 1e30, final rst only). <output1> hst every cycle kept.
